Output public/pages/extensions/footer/scene.mp4
Source tapes/common/settings.tape
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type "node scenes/run.mjs pages/extensions/footer"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Sleep 1s
# cue: ready
Sleep 2s
Type "/plan start"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 600ms
# cue: planning
Sleep 5200ms
Type "/plan exit"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 600ms
# cue: back
Sleep 7s
